## Exact TypeScript 7.0.x check (registry, 2026-11-28)

- `npm view typescript versions --json`: the only stable 7.0.x is `7.0.2` (published 2026-07-08). `7.0.1-rc` is a
  pre-release.
- `npm view typescript dist-tags --json`: `latest` is `7.0.2`. `beta` is `7.1.0-beta` (2026-10-20).
  `next` is `7.1.0-dev.20261127.1`.
- `npm view typescript@7.0.2 bin exports dependencies --json`: bin `tsc`. `exports` holds `.` (to `./lib/version.cjs`)
  and `./unstable/*` only. The classic compiler API is not in the root export. Platform binaries are optional dependencies.
- TR1 repeats the check on the trial day (`TS_CHOSEN=`). The chosen value is the numeric maximum of the stable 7.0.x list.

